<headroom-library version="1" id="hg-soaring-prog-lead" category="High Gain" order="210" instrument="guitar" style="Prog Metal">
  <description>Fluid, singing prog metal lead: an overdrive into a cascaded boutique head in its highest gain mode with the mids up, into a 4x12, then a half-second echo and a long plate. Legato runs flow, bends sustain for days, and the ambience trails behind without washing out fast lines.</description>
  <tags><tag>High Gain</tag><tag>Prog Metal</tag><tag>Lead</tag><tag>Fluid</tag><tag>Boosted</tag><tag>Delay</tag><tag>Plate</tag></tags>
  <sources>
    <source url="https://www.premierguitar.com/features/artist-features/john-petrucci-still-living-the-dream" title="Premier Guitar: John Petrucci, still living the dream"/>
    <source url="https://boogieforum.com/threads/petrucci-and-iic.54951/" title="Boogie Forum: Petrucci and the IIC+ (forum)"/>
    <source url="https://www.guitarworld.com/features/guthrie-govan-guitar-buying" title="Guitar World: Guthrie Govan on guitar buying"/>
  </sources>
</headroom-library>
</headroom-preset>
